---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="Learn about the Alma Consort, a young ensemble of professional choral singers based in London, directed by Luca Wetherall and Izzy Mohan.">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>About</h1>

    <p>
      The Alma Consort are a young ensemble of professional choral singers. Primarily based in London, we specialise in highly precise recordings and specialist events. We perform complex music in a range of genres including classical, pop, and jazz, often working to highly pressurised short turnarounds.
    </p>

    <p>
      Unlike other choirs, we are uniquely equipped to provide high-quality audio and video recordings in house as part of our hire fee. This service leads to significant savings and a quicker delivery time for our clients.
    </p>

    <p>
      The Alma Consort is directed by Luca Wetherall and Izzy Mohan.
    </p>

    <hr class="bio-divider" />

    <div class="bio">
      <p>
        <strong>Luca Wetherall</strong> is a conductor, singer, and pianist. He is Director of Music and Organist at St. Mary's Acton and Choral Director at St. John the Baptist Holland Road. A Clarendon Scholar at Oxford, his doctoral research focuses on popular music. He is also a Tutor at the Faculty of Music.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bio">
      <p>
        <strong>Izzy Mohan</strong> is a pianist, conductor, and singer. She is Director of Music at St Mary's Harrow-on-the-Hill and has performed at the Royal Festival Hall, Austrian Cultural Forum, and Oxford International Song Festival. She holds an MMus from the Royal Academy of Music (Ruth Harte Scholarship) and a First Class Degree from Oxford.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .bio-divider {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(60, 60, 60, 0.15);
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .bio {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .bio strong {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }
</style>
